    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebya Hoseya n'omukazi omusiihani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA akangamba ati: “Garuka ogende, ogonze omukazi ogu omusiihani, arukugonzibwa omusaija ondi; omugonze nka MUKAMA oku agonza abantu ba Isirairi, kandi kunu baheereza embandwa, kandi nibagonza ebitonge eby'ebijuma by'emizabbibbu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enjugano nahaire kuswera omukazi ogu, ekaba ebicweka by'efeeza ikumi na bitaano n'ebigega musanju ebya Sayiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namugambira nti: “Omale ebiro bingi oli wange; otalikisura okasiihana, rundi kutungwa omusaija ondi; nkooku olyerinda, na nyowe nukwo ndyerinda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana ba Isirairi nabo nukwo balimara akasumi bati bataina mukama rundi mulemi, batarukutamba byonzira, bataina ibaale eriraihire, bataina bisisani eby'okwekoonyeza kuragura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi obu birihwaho, abaana ba Isirairi baligaruka baserre MUKAMA Ruhanga wabo, na Daudi omukama wabo; baliija hali MUKAMA nibakankana, batunge ebirungi bye ebiribaho omu biro eby'omu maiso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
